<title>USA: United Air Specialists Q2 full results.</title>
<headline>United Air Specialists Q2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					     December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $9,735 $10,959 $19,470 $20,853</p>
<p> Operating Profit		     302     944     865   1,593</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Income			 233     627     686   1,052</p>
<p> Net Income			     144     337     420     631</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number</p>
<p>   of Shares Outstanding*	 3,188   3,123   3,186   3,109</p>
<p> Earnings per Share*		  .05     .12     .13     .20</p>
<p>*Retroactively restated to reflect the increased number of common shares outstanding due to a five-for-four stock split payable February 2, 1996 for shareholders of record on January 19, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610)</p>
